polygon 142,141 144,146 147,145 148,147 152,144 154,147 158,145 158,158 48,158 66,145 71,144 72,146 75,145 77,147 82,147 85,142 86,144 95,144 96,142 100,142 91,155 91,158 137,158 137,155 128,142 131,144 140,144 142,142
